# ZAHO Design System — Color Rule

All UI (site vitrine, dashboard, future modules) **must** use tokens from `Styles/Shared/_tokens.css`. Do not hardcode hex/rgb in page or layout CSS.

## Workflow (reuse first)

1. **Read `_tokens.css`** before styling — use an existing token if it fits.
2. **Use `color-mix()`** for tints/opacity on an existing token (e.g. `color-mix(in srgb, var(--gold) 45%, transparent)`) before inventing a new hex.
3. **Add a new token** in `_tokens.css` only when no existing token can express the intent — then update `docs/DESIGN-SYSTEM.md`.
4. **Never duplicate hex** in dashboard module CSS (`Styles/Vente/`, `Styles/Shared/_Dashboard*.css`), `Home/Index.css`, or `@theme` in `app.css` — `@theme` must reference `var(--…)` from `_tokens.css`.
5. **Split by module** — see `.cursor/rules/dashboard-css.mdc` (Tailwind first; `Styles/Vente/Devis.css`, `Styles/Vente/Clients.css`, etc.).

## Core tokens

| Purpose | Token |
|---------|-------|
| Page background | `--cream` |
| Dark surfaces (topbar, hero) | `--pine` |
| Body text on light bg | `--ink` |
| Text on dark bg | `--cream` |
| Primary accent / CTAs | `--gold` → hover `--gold-soft` |
| Button label text | `--btn-color` |
| Borders & dividers | `--line` |
| Muted labels | `--muted` |
| Active nav / table header bg | `--slot-bg` |
| Card / panel surface | `--surface` |
| Focus ring | `--gold-soft` |
| Olive accent (borders, success) | `--footer-link` |

## Semantic tokens (dashboard)

| Purpose | Token |
|---------|-------|
| Success bg (badge, alert) | `--success-bg` |
| Warning bg | `--warn-bg` |
| Danger / delete / validation error | `--danger` |
| Danger hover & error text | `--danger-hover` |
| Danger alert bg | `--danger-bg` |
| Box shadow | `--shadow-color` |

## Typography

- **Display / headings:** `'Fraunces', serif`
- **UI / body:** `'Work Sans', sans-serif`
- **Font sizes & spacing:** rem only — `--text-*` and `--space-*` from `_tokens.css`; px only for borders, shadows, radius, fixed shell (see `.cursor/rules/css-typography-rem.mdc`)

## Do not

- Hardcode `#8B2942`, `#E8F0E4`, `#FFF8E1`, `rgba(199,162,74,.45)`, etc. in component CSS
- Use generic blues, grays, or Bootstrap defaults
- Add new tokens for every shade — prefer `color-mix` on `--gold`, `--slot-bg`, `--pine`, etc.
- Use rounded corners (8px+) on dashboard buttons, tables, or panels — keep edges **sharp** (`border-radius: 0`)

## Reference files

- `Styles/Shared/_tokens.css` — **single source of truth** for color hex values
- `docs/DESIGN-SYSTEM.md` — full token and component spec
- `Styles/app.css` — `@theme` mirrors tokens for Tailwind utilities
